    "Every tab of kansō settings, 860 wide, dark and light, in Stable Mode and Dawn Mode.",
    "No Dawn band in the settings header; the channel shows only in the sidebar header.",
    "Browse the window (or Find) shows a small map: Sidebar, Tab bar, Pane header, Panels, Status bar, Notifications, and Behind the scenes. Picking an area shows its 3 to 11 rows. No area scrolls at 680.",
    "One switch per row. A piece that only speaks when needed says so in three dim words (only when low, only after a turn). Three options only for Channel mark (Artwork, Pill, Hidden).",
    "What hiding saves is said once, in the area's line, only for Sidebar, Pane header, Status bar, Tab bar and Behind the scenes.",
    "Find searches every area; results name their area in dim; none found is one dim sentence.",
