    "Older releases fold to one line (version, date, change count) and open in place.",
    "Switching channel arms; the band then appears on the sidebar header.",
    "Remote: one GET of CHANGELOG.md and one git ls-remote --tags on open or Refresh.",
    "The Simulator is kansō's own code since 3.31.0; no herdr-sim row.",
